Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 08:58:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD Vim visual selection yanks for both terminal panes

Support Vim-style visual cursor, character, line, and block yanks from the focused terminal pane so both left-pane rows and right-pane chat text copy through the same visual selection path.
